    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d158">

                <pb facs="0298" n="268" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v5/pg268"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">No. 19.</note>
                <head>Mr. Nicholas Fish to Mr.
                        Fish.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 421.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1872-11-02"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 2, 1872</date>. (Received November 19.)</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I annex a copy and translation of a note
                    from the Secretary of State for Foreign Affairs, in reply to Mr. Bancroft’s of
                    the 21st ultimo, in regard to the costs and expenses of this Government in the
                    Northwest Boundary arbitration.<seg type="margin">Re-imbursement’s of costs and
                        expenses of the Arbitration declined. </seg></p>
                <pb facs="0299" n="269" xml:id="pg269"/>
                <p>The German Government decline to accept payment for their expenses in the
                    matter.</p>
                <p>In order that I may know the more fully the wish of the Department as to the
                    course of acknowledging this friendly act, I delay answering Mr. Von Balan’s
                    note until I receive a reply to the telegram I sent you which ran as follows:
                    “Fish, Secretary, Washington: German Government decline compensation for
                    expenses of arbitration. (Signed.) Fish, Chargé.”</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>NICHOLAS FISH, <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires ad
                        interim</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d158-a1.xml" xpointer="d158-a1"/>
            </div>
